          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bianca Berry said: \"Hey guys I just wanted to come on here and do a quick review of my new pop on veneers. I have my top in obviously but I wanted to I am a previous shiny smile customer and I kind of wanted to compare the two so this is my shiny smile set you can see they're just they're super flimsy I had a set crack up the front this second set got ate by a dog. but these are my pop on veneers so super super Stout yeah they do have a little give so they can move Over your teeth but also if you look right here they have put like a filling where I don't have a tooth so it keeps them more sturdy and lets you eat soft foods but overall the quality is phenomenal compared to the other ones I'm absolutely glad I made the switch. customer service is outstanding honestly I tried to order another set of these shiny smiles And after 3 weeks of not getting an answer of whether or not they had my scans on file I went ahead and made the leap to pop on veneers and I'm super super glad that I did. super easy to get in and out just pop right on they look great I've had so many compliments and I cannot wait honestly to order the Halloween ones that have the fangs but yeah you won't be disappointed make the switch or make the leap and get your perfect smile they are so simple so much more affordable than implants and nobody can tell the difference.\"</p><p>Jacques Malone said: \"Yes I chose to use pop on veneers because I used them before and they did a great job the first time and then I lost mine And I went with another company and they did a terrible job I mean the fit was totally wrong it don't even matter what company it was they just did a terrible job so I decided to go back with pop on veneers and I'm going to put my veneers on as you can see I'm missing quite a few teeth had quite a few of them pulled. So let me see. Now I have a brand new smile thanks to pop on veneers. thank you.\"</p><p>Valerie Wells said: \"Okay I'm here to try my pop on veneers that I got from pop on veneers I'm here to try those here and see how they are. so I'm going to have a review So here's my smile I don't like my smile I don't like my teeth so that's why I ordered the veneers I have ordered some before from a another company Which I would do another video in but these are from pop on veneers So I'm going to pop them in and let y'all see. so this is my smile which I don't like showing the world my smile but anyway I'm doing a video here for Pop on veneers so this is my smile I have 8 teeth on the bottom and I have nine teeth on the top so this is my smile. I got a terrible over bite this is my smile. and I have a chipped gold tooth as well so this is my smile. so now I'm going to get ready and pop on the veneers that I got. so I'm going to do the bottom one first. here it goes. snapped on there see how they look I like they cover the whole bottom see it covers the whole bottom of my mouth I like they fit comfortable they feel nice. they feel nice. now I'm going to pop on the top. now it covers they feel nice this is my smile. and I like. and I'm a classy lady and when I put on my clothes I like to look nice And I like to have a nice smile because I love to laugh. and I'm a clown so I like to have a nice smile so I'm very impressed and I'm very happy with my pop on veneers from pop on veneers. so this is my smile and I'm going to take them out. they're easy to take out and there it goes I took them out you see. so that's it so we're going to pop them back in. you see how they look they're very not so thin like the previous order that I had from another company I like how they're much stronger and heavier than the one I had previous so I really love the quality that they are I really do love the quality and the time that they took to prepare these here. So I'm going to snap them back in now. now I popped them back in see okay and then I'm going to snap the top back in. now you see and that's it pop on veneers from pop on veneers you better go get yourself some I'm very impressed with the pop on veneers but as I said I ordered something from another company which I will do in another video which I'm not happy at all with yes so try Pop on veneers it's a good company to get your pop on veneers to get your next veneers from so get your veneers so good luck and I'm very impressed pop on veneers have a good one.\"</p>",
